WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.890
It's so peaceful.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.270
Huh?

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:08.020
Too much has happened since 
I started high school.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.700
If I hadn't met that fuzzball,

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.070
I would've had an ordinary high school life.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:20.680
But I want to pet his fluffy fur again.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.020
Yeah, his fur certainly was nice.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.890
He was creepy and scary,

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.710
but when I slept, he'd curl up 
just so right next to my head.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.030
It felt great.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.010
What is he, a pillow?

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.390
If all yokai were fuzzballs, 
this job might not be so bad.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:38.010
Fuzzballs?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.020
I seriously can't handle man-eating yokai,

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.270
but if they're fuzzball jobs, bring 'em on!

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.650
Bring 'em on, my ass.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:48.700
I know what you want to say!

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.520
I'm a five-year-old who 
can't even handle an errand!

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.430
I'm just a useless dead weight

00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:56.760
who ultimately needed your help.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.780
I might as well just...

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.300
You're such a pain in the butt.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.660
Give me your hand.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:03.450
Huh?

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.460
What is this?

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.520
It's your pay for that last job.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:11.160
In the end, you did manage to return
the mask to Mitsuchigura-sama.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:14.220
But I owe you a million yen.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.460
Save up, then return it to me.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.720
Once you return it in full, 
I'll let you quit this job.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.280
Okay.

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:24.980
Hey, Abeno-san...

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:30.840
You don't suppose Fuzzy will come 
back to the mundane world, do you?

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:33.480
I want to see him again.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.900
If you stick with this job, 
you might run into him eventually.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:39.150
Really?

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:43.610
Now, will you meet him first, 
or pay off your debt first?

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:20.470
<b>Mystery 4: The Underworld</b>

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.100
You're going out?

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.760
I'll be gone today and tomorrow.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.180
I don't need you annoying me with your 
concern again, so I'm letting you know.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:25.180
Where are you going?

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.310
The Kiyakudo.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.630
Kiyakudo?

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:31.690
Hey, you didn't need to tell him.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.980
Kiyakudo? That sounds familiar.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.440
Oh, right!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.820
That's the apothecary you 
mentioned to Big Boss Scree!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.140
Uh, yeah.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:46.490
But isn't it in the Underworld?

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:47.700
Which means...

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.490
Abeno-san, you can enter the Underworld?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:54.580
You can go too, Hanae.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.580
"You can go too, Hanae?"

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:55.920
Seriously?

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:56.760
Hey!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:01.420
Wouldn't it be good for Hanae 
to see the Underworld once?

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:00.900
"Would it be good for Hanae to see..."

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.590
Go take a field trip to the Underworld.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.590
A field trip to the Underworld?

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.080
What? He's terrified of yokai.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.600
He'd never visit a place full of them.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.270
I want to go.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:13.370
What?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:22.070
See? Take him with you!

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:19.000
No! And how can you say you want to go?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.070
You just see this as a test 
of courage, don't you?

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:26.330
H-Honestly, I am a little curious...

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.960
B-But, I mean...

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:31.240
If I'm going to be working for you,

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:33.800
I want to learn more about the job and yokai!

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:38.410
Is that still not a good enough reason?

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.150
This Saturday, then.

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.780
We don't have class.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:49.980
Meet me on the roof at twelve.

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.320
Really?!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.060
Good for you.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:54.360
Yeah!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:05:01.030
Don't let any yokai eat your eyes or ears!

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:59.480
"Don't let any yokai eat your eyes or ears"?

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.030
R-Right.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.420
The school shop's closed on Saturday, 
so wanna hit a restaurant?

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.530
Thanks for treating us.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.530
You're so generous!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.290
<i>Since that day, even when I see him at school,</i>

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:12.540
<i>Abeno-san falls asleep immediately 
and leaves before I know it.</i>

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.910
<i>I didn't get to ask what the Underworld's like.</i>

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:19.750
<i>What if it looks like those paintings of Hell?</i>

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:23.610
Gotcha, Ashiyan.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:24.920
Fusshi!

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.880
Where'd you get the camera?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.560
I'm in the photography club.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.860
I'm taking pictures for an upcoming contest.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.040
Yeah?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.930
I took a picture of a cat earlier.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.360
Let me see.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:36.190
Sure.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:37.940
That's scary!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.420
Right?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:40.810
I ended up with this.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:44.160
Go to the nurse's office!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.110
Where is that, again?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.900
Straight down this hallway!

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:51.210
You'll find gauze and ointment 
in the white cupboard!

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:54.430
Of course you'd know, 
"Hanae-chan of the Nurse's Office."

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.080
What kind of nickname is that?

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.920
But I don't want to use medicine. It stings.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.580
You have to disinfect it!

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:02.100
Sure.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.500
<i>Medicine, huh?</i>

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.010
<i>The medicine Abeno-san's going to buy</i>

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:11.370
<i>must be the one he used on Big Boss Scree.</i>

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:18.280
<i>Maybe that medicine is something 
exorcists need to have around.</i>

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.080
Abeno-san.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:25.540
That's not the kimono you usually wear.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.880
I wear this when I visit the Underworld.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.320
You wear this.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.200
Me, too?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.140
I don't want to.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.840
I only had a women's cloak.

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:39.120
Suck it up.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:43.310
As long as you wear that, 
they'll know you work for me.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:45.880
If you don't want to be possessed, put it on.

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:48.250
I'd rather be possessed...

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:48.970
Put it on.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.880
Also, the Mononokean wanted 
me to give you this.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.780
The Mononokean? For me?

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:59.520
<b>Thrilling                   Exciting
Rules for Visiting the 
Underworld: Beginner Edition
1) Don't get lost in the Underworld!
 2) Don't follow strange yokai!
3) Listen to Itsuki and don't quarrel!
4) Say something immediately if you get 
Underworld Sickness and feel unwell!
Dress Code: Clothes Featuring Crest
 Destination: Kiyakudo
Try not to get hurt, and have a safe trip
From the Mononokean</b>

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:00.590
Is this a field trip?

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:01.750
No.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.480
It made me write that 
weird note this morning.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:09.190
Anyway, you just need to 
follow the rules written there.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:14.030
Is the Mononokean treating 
me like a child now, too?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.790
<i>You must be careful.</i>

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.340
<i>Ashiya-sama is dangerous.</i>

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:26.600
What? You'd better not tell me I look like 
a creep after forcing me to wear this!

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:28.830
Or if you say it suits me, that's even worse!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:29.980
You look fine.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.050
I look fine?

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:37.930
I'm opening the door.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:43.210
Mononokean master, Abeno Haruitsuki,

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:46.330
requesting a portal to the Underworld.

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:58.330
Hey, can I ask you something?

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.530
What?

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:04.080
Mitsuchigura-san entered the Underworld 
through the Mononokean's nijiriguchi, right?

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:08.640
Only the master of the Mononokean 
can travel between this world and

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:10.480
the Underworld through the Mononokean.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.370
Because he entered from the Underworld,

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:15.090
he couldn't exit into this world.

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:18.060
That's why he hired us.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.160
I see.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.600
And because you entered from this world,

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.080
you can't exit into the Underworld.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.880
What? Then...

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:29.210
The doors to the Underworld 
connect it to this world,

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.610
making it possible to pass between them.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:36.440
I see. Then I'll be okay 
if I enter through this door.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.120
That's why I don't want to do this.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:43.260
If I take you, I have to open this door twice,

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.610
once to get there and once to come back.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:48.560
Oh, right, and then you'll 
collapse from exhaustion.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:51.600
Before we go, I have a another rule for you.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:52.510
What is it?

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.640
While we're in the Underworld,

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.640
don't let anyone know you're a human.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.140
That's it.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.520
Now let's go.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.360
What'll happen to me if someone finds out?

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:12.150
Well, they won't let you die easily.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.360
My life depends on following that rule, then!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.740
Do you not want to go?

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:21.230
No! I want to go!

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:22.260
Oh, really?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.610
<i>I'm scared...</i>

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:32.050
<i>But I hope I see Fuzzy again.</i>

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:37.050
<b>The Morose Mononokean</b>

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:47.310
<i>So this is the Underworld, home of the yokai.</i>

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.810
<i>I hope Fuzzy isn't all by himself...</i>

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:54.820
<i>What if Big Boss Scree ran out 
of strength on his way here?</i>

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:59.490
<i>Suddenly I feel really anxious.</i>

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.350
<i>And my body feels weak...</i>

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:04.830
<i>Now I feel sick.</i>

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.170
<i>Huh? Could this be...</i>

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.330
<b>4) Say something immediately if you get 
Underworld Sickness and feel unwell!</b>

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:12.090
<i>Well, it's not as if I can't walk.</i>

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.710
Hey, we're almost at the exit.

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:17.860
O-Okay.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:18.940
You're sick, aren't you?

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.280
I'm not sick.

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:22.860
Quit acting tough.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.890
The rules said to tell me 
immediately if you feel sick.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:27.890
I'm not sick.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:32.200
You are! Underworld sickness can 
make you emotionally unstable.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.280
That's why you should speak up right away.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.650
Tsk. I told you, I'm not sick.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:42.140
Whoops. Rule number one was no quarreling.

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:45.030
Is that the exit?

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.670
He's completely lost his mind.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:10:59.880
So bright...

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.460
This is the Underworld?!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.430
Quit staring and let's go.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.020
O-Okay.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.800
I thought it'd be creepier.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.070
It's a lot like our world.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.070
It's pretty bright.

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:28.580
It's nothing like the tunnel we were just in.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:32.580
And, wait... I'm over my 
Underworld Sickness, too.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.360
So you <i>were</i> sick!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:35.460
Whoops!

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:38.880
We're here.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.430
This is the Kiyakudo.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.560
Welcome.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.560
Oh, Itsuki.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.310
It's been a while.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:56.420
Long time, no see. 
Some mess you've got in here.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.520
What? Humans?!

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:02.700
Shizuku's gotten better at transforming 
into a human, don't you think?

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.910
Praise me more, Koura-sama.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.190
You've still got your newt's tail, though.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.150
A tail?

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:13.670
It's hard to make this thing go away!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:18.180
You seem more like yourself with 
your tail, Shizuku. I like it.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:22.280
If that's what you think, 
I don't mind keeping it.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.680
I see you're still in love with your master.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:28.170
Koura, I'm here for the usual medicine.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:30.960
I thought you'd be coming soon.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:33.100
But first...

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:34.760
What are you doing?

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:37.680
I haven't touched you recently.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.980
You smell just as nice as ever.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.200
I really envy these fingers, too.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.660
I just can't stop loving this body.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.110
<i>What? Why did things suddenly turn naughty?!</i>

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.110
Don't touch me! Let go!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.660
Especially these eyes.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:51.360
With these eyes, I could make 
the highest quality medicine.

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:53.210
I couldn't care less, 
you pharmaceutical freak!

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:56.430
First you dry the eyeballs,

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:59.780
then you thinly slice and boil them...

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:02.970
Just the thought of making 
medicine with your body

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.630
sends chills through me.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.990
<i>I thought it was naughty, 
but it's just morbid!</i>

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.230
I'd make a much better medicine.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.420
I hope Itsuki's eyes crumble and disappear.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:16.940
<i>For some reason, she's jealous!</i>

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:20.720
By the way, who is this boy?

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.970
Oh, I'm Ashiya.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.680
He's my new employee.

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.200
Oh, really?

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:34.250
How rude of us not to introduce ourselves.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:37.530
I'm Koura, master of the Kiyakudo.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:40.240
I'm Shizuku, the store's employee.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.020
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:45.720
Oh... Yes, it's nice to meet you.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:48.470
<i>They look normal enough...</i>

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.920
Ashiya-kun, you have some nice ears.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:54.490
How would you feel about 
selling them to me as a set?

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:57.730
<i>But in some ways, they're 
the scariest yokai I've met!</i>

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:00.720
I'd take a tooth or tongue or finger.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.320
Wha... Koura-san?

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.320
I'd even take an organ.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.200
My ears are better than Ashiya's.

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:07.490
Koura, quit playing around 
and get the medicine.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.700
Oh, right. I forgot to tell you.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:13.290
I don't have any right now.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.680
You don't? What do you mean?

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:19.100
I accidentally gave it to 
another customer the other day.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.650
What? Why?

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.560
Don't get mad at Koura-sama!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.840
It's not Koura-sama's fault.

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:29.800
You told a demon you exorcised 
about our shop, didn't you?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:30.340
Huh?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.510
It was some screeching yokai.

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:35.680
Big Boss Scree?

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.600
Oh, that yokai.

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.600
That's great! He made it here okay!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:44.250
That so-called "big boss" came to our shop.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.860
He insisted he knew you, 
so I gave him that medicine.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:52.620
Naturally, I put it on the Mononokean's tab.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:55.740
That's what I intended, so that's fine.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:59.450
We gave him your portion 
of the medicine then, too.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:01.870
We knew you'd be mad,

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:06.040
but when we saw his condition, 
we couldn't help it.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.570
No, sorry for yelling at you.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:11.260
I appreciate the consideration 
you showed for my client.

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:14.570
Koura, I hate to ask for another favor,

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:17.110
but I need you to make some more 
of that medicine in a hurry.

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.270
Naturally, I'll pay extra.

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:20.900
Please.

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:22.230
<i>Abeno-san...</i>

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.530
I bet I could use the medicine to 
blackmail you for your eyes now.

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:32.350
We can't give it to you yet, 
but it'll be ready soon.

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.160
I must hurry.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.200
So fast!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:37.420
We were just finishing up.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.660
It won't be done for a while. 
Do you mind waiting?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:40.660
That's fine.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.920
As long as you're waiting, I have a request.

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.170
What?

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:48.540
Itsuki and Ashiya-kun...

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.430
I want your hands.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.700
Hands?!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:56.050
<i>Now she's asking for our hands?</i>

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:59.450
When she said she wanted our hands,

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:02.840
she meant she wanted help around the store?

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:05.820
I thought she wanted to cut them off.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:08.460
She knew what she was saying.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.120
She's toying with you.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.460
It'll give us something to do while we wait,

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:15.160
so I don't mind helping them, but...

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:17.660
<i>Their ingredients are so gross.</i>

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.720
Huh? It's not here.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:21.160
What's wrong?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:24.590
The inventory list for one 
of the shelves is missing.

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:27.960
I'll go check with Shizuku.
You keep working.

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.210
Okay.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.920
I hate visiting their workshop.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.320
I hope I don't hear any screams.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.880
<i>I hope I don't hear Abeno-san's screams.</i>

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:45.950
Anyway, they've got all kinds of ingredients.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:50.380
Let's see... Which jar has the same contents?

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:51.450
Is that it?

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:53.820
Huh?

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.980
Was that...

00:16:58.320 --> 00:16:59.080
Fuzzy!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:03.470
I could probably catch up if I ran,

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.860
but Abeno-san will yell at 
me if I leave the shop.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:08.840
Is this...

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:11.290
Blood?! Is he...

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:16.090
<i>Abeno-san will probably be furious later.</i>

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.600
<i>With that much blood dripping, 
he must be badly hurt!</i>

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.730
Fuzzy, wait! Wait!

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.740
Fuzzy, stop!

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.780
Fuzzy! It's me!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:35.070
What happened to you? You're dripping bloo—

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:41.130
Dripping... juice?

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:44.200
Are you Fuzzy?

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:50.630
A doppelgänger...

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.660
He's a fuzzball-doppelgänger.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:58.970
Fuzzball-doppelgänger, you dropped this!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.230
I guess he can't hear me.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.490
What should I do?

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:04.540
Hey!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.420
Wait up!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.620
Where did that thief go?!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.340
What was that?

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.720
Oh, right... I left the store 
without telling Abeno-san.

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.770
I'd better get back and 
act like nothing happened.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:24.000
I caught you, you thief.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.000
A capybara?

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.460
No, I mean... Who are you calling a thief?!

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:30.000
You thought transforming would help you 
escape, but I've got bad news for you!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.620
You won't get away today!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.860
What did I even do to you?

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:37.470
Look closely at what's in your hand!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.130
Huh?

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.390
That's the fruit you stole from my shop!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.700
Fruit?

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:47.790
No! Some yokai I don't know dropped it!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.020
I just happened to pick it up!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.870
Thieves like you don't learn their lesson

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:02.840
until they're made to suffer.

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.200
That crest...

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:08.670
Is it the Mononokean's crest?

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:11.690
Huh? Yeah, it is...

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.150
Mononokean?

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:15.020
The exorcist?

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.210
I've never seen one before.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.720
<i>Is the Mononokean famous here?</i>

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:22.970
How are you related to your Mononokean?

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.720
Um, I'm a part-time employee.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.630
A part-time employee, huh?

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.780
Well, that changes everything.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:35.560
Wouldn't an amicable settlement 
better suit us both?

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:37.070
What exactly do you mean by that?

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:40.400
Since you work at the Mononokean,

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.730
they must pay you pretty well, right?

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:47.440
If you give me all your money, 
I'll forgive you for what you've done.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:50.860
What do you say? Not a bad deal, right?

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:53.330
All my money?

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:58.090
Um, this is all I have.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.390
Do we have a deal?

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.340
The deal's off!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.340
I knew it!

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:07.900
How dare you try to pay me in change?!

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.380
Wait, wait!

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:10.430
I heard a rumor that recently,

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:13.150
the master of the Mononokean's 
been working alone.

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:15.480
You mean there are no employees?

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:20.990
I see. You lied about working at the 
Mononokean so you could get away.

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:27.360
Come to think of it, an employee of 
the Mononokean wouldn't steal things.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.630
I told you, I didn't steal anything!

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.960
I really am an employee of the Mononokean!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.500
I'm not lying!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.280
Liars always become thieves.

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:39.580
I'll remember your face.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:42.680
And so you'll never steal again...

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:46.970
What's wrong with you? 
That thing's dangerous!

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:47.600
Stop waving—

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:51.720
I'll make sure you never use that arm again!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.310
<i>He actually tried to cut me!</i>

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.250
Don't run.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:03.490
Hold still, or I might miss and 
cut something other than your arm.

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.710
I don't really want to do this, you know.

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:11.360
But if I let you go, what message 
will it send to other thieves?

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:15.720
Listen up! When you steal 
from me, this is what happens!

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:16.750
Watch closely!

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.370
<i>Oh, no.</i>

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.230
<i>Huh?</i>

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:29.350
What the hell are you doing?

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:35.560
Get off me, you bastard!

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:35.560
Fuzzball-doppelgänger?

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.940
No, that's not him.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.060
Let go, damn it!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:46.980
Huh?

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:51.180
You're the real Fuzzy?

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time "The Legislative Lake"</b>

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:29.080
Fuzzy, I've missed you!

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.440
Who said you could walk around on your own?

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:32.800
Fuzzy!

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:34.060
Are you listening, Ashiya?

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:35.580
Fuzzy!

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:38.980
He's hopeless.
